flowchart TD
  START["Day 90 gate at the end of Month 3<br/>Owner: Lucy decides, Mark prepares the numbers<br/>Step 1: check the five kill triggers. Step 2: check the six pass tests"]
  START --> K1["Kill trigger 1<br/>Hero SKU conversion below 5%?"]
  START --> K2["Kill trigger 2<br/>TACOS above 40% in Month 3?"]
  START --> K3["Kill trigger 3<br/>Return rate above 7%?"]
  START --> K4["Kill trigger 4<br/>Hero contribution before<br/>advertising below $8 per unit?"]
  START --> K5["Kill trigger 5<br/>Cash runway below 2 months?"]
  K1 -->|"Yes"| KILL
  K2 -->|"Yes"| KILL
  K3 -->|"Yes"| KILL
  K4 -->|"Yes"| KILL
  K5 -->|"Yes"| KILL
  K1 -->|"No"| CLEAR
  K2 -->|"No"| CLEAR
  K3 -->|"No"| CLEAR
  K4 -->|"No"| CLEAR
  K5 -->|"No"| CLEAR
  KILL["KILL. Any one trigger kills. No further capital. Sell down inventory,<br/>delist losers, move to Plan B: B2B installer distribution plus Korea<br/>wholesale"]
  CLEAR["No kill trigger hit. Now all six<br/>pass tests must pass"]
  CLEAR --> P1["Pass test 1<br/>Conversion at or above 8% on at<br/>least 3 of the 5 launch SKUs?"]
  CLEAR --> P2["Pass test 2<br/>TACOS at or below 30% in Month 3<br/>and falling month over month?"]
  CLEAR --> P3["Pass test 3<br/>Return rate at or below 4%?"]
  CLEAR --> P4["Pass test 4<br/>Contribution before advertising at<br/>or above $11 per unit on at least<br/>3 of 5 SKUs?"]
  CLEAR --> P5["Pass test 5<br/>Cash runway at or above 4 months<br/>after funding the next PO?"]
  CLEAR --> P6["Pass test 6<br/>No suppressed listing and no IP<br/>complaint open more than 14 days?"]
  P1 -->|"No"| HOLD
  P2 -->|"No"| HOLD
  P3 -->|"No"| HOLD
  P4 -->|"No"| HOLD
  P5 -->|"No"| HOLD
  P6 -->|"No"| HOLD
  P1 -->|"Yes"| ALL
  P2 -->|"Yes"| ALL
  P3 -->|"Yes"| ALL
  P4 -->|"Yes"| ALL
  P5 -->|"Yes"| ALL
  P6 -->|"Yes"| ALL
  HOLD["REVIEW. Fix the failed test and retest in 30 days. No new capital<br/>beyond the committed PO. One retest only, then pass or kill"]
  ALL["All six pass"]
  ALL --> SCALE["SCALE. Ocean freight PO on proven SKUs, delist losers, keep air for<br/>new SKUs, next review at Month 12"]
  HOLD -.->|"Retest once"| START
  SCALE --> M12["Month 12 gate. Pass needs all of: revenue at or above $70K per month,<br/>cumulative net at or above $0, TACOS at or below 15%, return rate at<br/>or below 3%, operating cash flow positive two months in a row.<br/>Kill on any one of: revenue below $50K per month, cumulative net below<br/>($25K), TACOS above 25%, return rate above 5%, three months of<br/>negative operating cash flow with a funding gap above $50K"]
  LEG["Legend. TACOS: total advertising cost of sales (ad spend divided by total revenue). SKU: stock keeping unit.<br/>PO: purchase order. IP: intellectual property. Contribution: price minus landed cost, referral, FBA fee and<br/>returns, before advertising. Hero SKU: 8K 10M. Thresholds from the kill criteria in the risk register."]

  class START,CLEAR step
  class K1,K2,K3,K4,K5,P1,P2,P3,P4,P5,P6 dec
  class KILL kill
  class SCALE,ALL good
  class HOLD ext
  class M12 step
  class LEG legend

